listing:   tables.cc (BOOTX64.EFI)
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18); OVMF from the ovmf package 2024.02-2ubuntu0.10
command:   three times: python3 ../F3-10/qemu_run.py --timeout 60 --stamp -- qemu-system-x86_64 -machine q35 -smp 2 -m 256M -display none -serial stdio -no-reboot -net none -boot menu=on,splash-time=3000 -drive if=pflash,...OVMF_CODE_4M.fd -drive if=pflash,...OVMF_VARS_4M.fd(copy) -drive format=raw,file=fat:rw:esp -device isa-debug-exit,iobase=0xf4,iosize=0x04 | grep -E 'BdsDxe: starting|time-stamp|tables: done'
date:      2026-10-09T20:31:00Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 33 (status of the third boot; all three must be 33)
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU 8.2.2 q35 machine with the distribution's OVMF, not a real PC; the first column is host seconds since QEMU started (measured in this container, TCG emulation, shared with other work)
